      "source": [
        "# 🎙️ TurboVoiceCloner: Advanced TTS Server & RVC Studio\n",
        "**Features:** Chatterbox Server | Ultimate RVC | YouTube Support | Turbo Speed (CUDA 12.1)\n",
        "\n",
        "### ⚠️ महत्वपूर्ण (Setup):\n",
        "1. **GPU को सक्षम करें:** Runtime → Change runtime type → GPU (T4 अनुशंसित)\n",
        "2. **पुष्टि करें:** सुनिश्चित करें कि आप T4 GPU का उपयोग कर रहे हैं।"
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# @title 🚀 Step 1: Install Chatterbox & RVC Dependencies\n",
        "# @markdown यह सेल Chatterbox Server और PyTorch CUDA 12.1 सेटअप करेगा।\n",
        "\n",
        "# Clone the Chatterbox-TTS-Server repository\n",
        "!git clone https://github.com/devnen/Chatterbox-TTS-Server.git\n",
        "%cd Chatterbox-TTS-Server\n",
        "\n",
        "# Install PyTorch (CUDA 12.1 build) - Turbo Speed\n",
        "!pip install torch==2.5.1+cu121 torchaudio==2.5.1+cu121 torchvision==0.20.1+cu121 --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu121 -q\n",
        "\n",
        "# Install Chatterbox and Server Dependencies\n",
        "!pip install git+https://github.com/devnen/chatterbox.git -q\n",
        "!pip install fastapi uvicorn pyyaml soundfile librosa safetensors -q\n",
        "!pip install python-multipart requests jinja2 watchdog aiofiles unidecode inflect tqdm -q\n",
        "!pip install pydub audiotsm ultimate-rvc[cuda] --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu128 -q\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"✅ All core components installed successfully!\")"
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# @title ⚙️ Step 2: Start TTS Server\n",
        "# @markdown यह सेल TTS सर्वर को FastAPI और Uvicorn के साथ शुरू करेगा।\n",
        "\n",
        "import threading, time, uvicorn, gc, os\n",
        "from google.colab.output import serve_kernel_port_as_window\n",
        "\n",
        "# Clear any old servers\n",
        "!fuser -k 8004/tcp 2>/dev/null || echo \"Port clear\"\n",
        "!pkill -f \"uvicorn.*server\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"No running servers\"\n",
        "gc.collect()\n",
        "\n",
        "def run_server():\n",
        "    from server import app\n",
        "    uvicorn.run(app, host=\"0.0.0.0\", port=8004, log_level=\"warning\", access_log=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"🚀 Starting TTS server...\")\n",
        "thread = threading.Thread(target=run_server, daemon=True)\n",
        "thread.start()\n",
        "time.sleep(25)  # wait for model to load\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"🎉 Server ready! Click the link below to open the interface:\")\n",
        "serve_kernel_port_as_window(8004)"
      ],
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
